@startuml 5-pdpa
' 5. PDPA - add friend, message before accepting, accept, message after accepting
' Traced from code at dev-rewrite e09d47b (2026-10-11) . box = file . arrow = function calls function
' italic = what that function does to PSQL / LINE
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox
autonumber

title 5. PDPA

actor "LINE\n(reporter)" as LINE
participant "api/\nline.py" as API
participant "controllers/\nline.py" as CTRL
participant "clients/\nline.py\n(LINE API)" as CL
participant "services/\npdpa.py" as PDPA
participant "services/\nuser.py" as USER
participant "clients/\ndatabase.py\n(PSQL)" as CDB

== entry point of every event ==
LINE -> API : POST /webhook/line\nbody + X-Line-Signature
API -> API : webhook(request, x_line_signature)
API -> CTRL : line.handle_webhook(body, signature)
CTRL -> CL : line.parse_events(body, signature)\n<i>WebhookParser.parse - checks the signature, then parses the events</i>
alt signature does not match
  CL --> CTRL : raise InvalidSignatureError
  CTRL --> API : raise InvalidSignatureError
  API --> LINE : 400 {"detail": "invalid signature"}
else signature matches
  CL --> CTRL : list[event]
  note right of CTRL
    dispatches each event by type
    FollowEvent -> on_follow
    PostbackEvent -> on_postback
    MessageEvent -> on_message
    any other type -> skipped
    after all events -> api returns "OK" (200)
  end note
end

== add friend (FollowEvent) ==
CTRL -> CTRL : on_follow(event)
CTRL -> PDPA : pdpa.card()
PDPA --> CTRL : FlexMessage\n<i>from pdpa_card.json - fixed wording (TC7 exception 3)</i>
CTRL -> CL : line.reply(event.reply_token, [card])\n<i>reply_message</i>
note right of CTRL : nothing about the reporter is stored yet

== message before accepting (MessageEvent) ==
CTRL -> CTRL : on_message(event)
CTRL -> USER : user.find_by_line_id(event.source.user_id)
USER -> CDB : select_user_by_line_id(line_user_id)\n<i>SELECT users WHERE line_user_id</i>
CDB --> USER : None
USER --> CTRL : None
CTRL -> PDPA : pdpa.card()
PDPA --> CTRL : FlexMessage
CTRL -> CL : line.reply(event.reply_token, [card])
note right of CTRL : returns - this message is not saved and not sent to the AI (LC1)

== accept (PostbackEvent) ==
CTRL -> CTRL : on_postback(event)
alt event.postback.data == pdpa.ACCEPT ("pdpa_accept")
  CTRL -> PDPA : pdpa.accept(event.source.user_id)
  PDPA -> CDB : insert_user(line_user_id)\n<i>INSERT users (line_user_id, pdpa_accepted_at = now())</i>\n<i>already exists -> returns the same row, same time</i>
  CDB --> PDPA : User
  PDPA --> CTRL : User
  note right of CTRL : no reply - the button's displayText already shows the tap
else any other data
  note right of CTRL : does nothing
end

== message after accepting (MessageEvent) ==
CTRL -> CTRL : on_message(event)
CTRL -> USER : user.find_by_line_id(event.source.user_id)
USER -> CDB : select_user_by_line_id(line_user_id)
CDB --> USER : User
USER --> CTRL : User
note right of CTRL : a User exists = accepted -> the message is saved, continues in 4-1
@enduml
